  "text": "beUI Native is free — Pro mobile blocks and screens are in presale from $99\n\nReserve\nbeUI Pro for mobile\nbeUI\nComponents\nBlocks\nAgents\nCharts\nPlayground\nSponsors\nLight theme\nLight theme\nDark theme\nDark theme\nSystem theme\nSystem theme\n1.9k\nGet Pro\n\nINTRO\n\nHome\nCHARTS\n14\nSankey Chart\nNEW\nTreemap\nCandlestick Chart\nDonut Chart\nVolume Profile\nStatus Bar\nComposition Chart\nFunnel Chart\nLiquidity Heatmap\nBump Chart\nOrder Book\nHeat Calendar\nReturns Calendar\nPrice Target Fan\nCharts\nFunnel Chart\nFunnel Chart\nCopy Page\n\nVertical and horizontal funnels with curved stages and animated number tooltips.\n\nPreview\nPreview\nPreview\nUsage\nUsage\nCode\nCode\nFrom first visit to first payment\n\nProduct conversion · Sample cohorts\n\nNext cohort\nVertical\nHorizontal\n24,000\n15,600\n10,800\n7,200\n4,320\nVisitors\n100.0%\nSigned up\n65.0%\nActivated\n45.0%\nStarted trial\n30.0%\nSubscribed\n18.0%\n24,000 → 4,320 people\nOverall conversion\n18.0%\n\nInspect a stage to see conversion and drop-off\n\nInstall\n\nAdd it with the shadcn CLI, or copy the source manually.\n\nCLI\nCLI\nManual\nManual\nbun\nbun\nnpm\nnpm\npnpm\npnpm\nyarn\nyarn\n$ bunx --bun shadcn add @beui/\nfunnel-chart\nfunnel-chart\nAPI Reference\nFunnelChart\nstages\nreadonly FunnelStage[]\n\nOrdered stages with finite, nonnegative counts; duplicate IDs are omitted.\n\n—\ndirection?\n\"horizontal\" | \"vertical\"\nvertical\nunit?\nstring\npeople\nlabel?\nstring\nConversion funnel\nformatValue?\n((value: number) => string)\n(value: number) => value.toLocaleString(\"en-US\", { maximumFractionDigits: 2 })\nclassName?\nstring\n—\nFunnelChartPlot\nclassName?\nstring\n—\nFunnelChartSummary\nclassName?\nstring\n—\nRelated components\nBump Chart\n\nAnimated rankings with curved paths, interactive rank dots, and tooltips.\n\nLiquidity Heatmap\n\nAnimated liquidity bands across price and time, with a price trace and depth tooltips.\n\nSankey Chart\nNEW\n\nWeighted flows between stages that draw in and morph with your data.\n\nAbout Funnel Chart\n\nFunnel Chart is an animated React conversion funnel chart. Stages are drawn as connected curved segments whose widths match their counts, in a vertical or horizontal direction, and the shapes morph with Framer Motion when the numbers change. Each stage has a tooltip with its count, conversion from the previous stage, the amount dropped or gained, and the share of the starting total, with animated numbers, and a summary shows overall conversion.\n\nWhen to use it\nA product analytics dashboard shows signup, activation and purchase conversion.\nA sales pipeline report shows leads moving through qualification, demo and close.\nA marketing page or campaign report shows where visitors drop off in a checkout flow.\nAccessibility\n\nEach stage is a native button whose accessible name gives its label, count, unit and share of the starting total, and the stages sit in a labeled ordered list. The tooltip opens on hover and on keyboard focus. With reduced motion enabled, stage shapes change without the morph.\n\nFAQ\nHow do I make a funnel chart in React?\nInstall the chart with the shadcn CLI and pass stages to FunnelChart, each with an id, label, value and optional color. With no children it renders FunnelChartPlot and FunnelChartSummary.\nCan the funnel be horizontal?\nYes. Set direction to horizontal. The default is vertical.\nCan I change the unit and number format?\nYes. Set unit, such as users or leads, and pass formatValue to format counts. label sets the chart's accessible name.\n\nUpdated Oct 18, 2026\n\nbeUI\nPro\nLimited Offer\n\n300+ blocks and premium motion components for React and Next.js.\n\n$179 lifetime access\n\nExplore beUI Pro\nSponsors\n\nDIAMOND\n\nTracwell\n\nVisitor insights for growth\n\nIllos\n\nAnimated illustrations for product sites\n\nBecome a sponsor",
